#: ../../source/docs/common-mouse-based-optical-flow-sensor-adns3080.rst:98
#: 171487cb461e4bc3bad26f1635970ebc 2ed291c51e67410b9680976b41fc85b0
#: cdf1cdababd24eb2807d33db9966edcd f95a4d77e6df4724a2edd50efbee27f4
