"Note 1: After capturing images, you will need to reset the sensor (i.e. "
"plug/unplug it) to restore it to the normal motion capture mode."
msgstr "注意 1：捕获图像后，需要重置传感器（即拔插一次）以将其恢复到正常运动捕获模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mouse-based-optical-flow-sensor-adns3080.rst:104
#: 169d7be0eee24fe0a471b2569ce35d47 61894dd72baf4172ad9d9c927db7b5ed
#: d2c6c6e746ed44afbca2868eb051f565 ff8cac6738f64bd2bb31a93437fbb5d6
