"Note 2: you should see the AP_OpticalFlow_ADNS3080's menu and any errors "
"appear in the Python Shell."
msgstr "注意 2：AP_OpticalFlow_ADNS3080 的菜单和任何错误信息应在 Python Shell 中显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mouse-based-optical-flow-sensor-adns3080.rst:108
#: 37f9b7cefe514ca3b725336c2e3ba35b 661c84a4e9b94d729ca4dd1b0e9ad203
#: d6731a159a1b4508bc0b130f5ba265e5 e05f1d4cbec54dae8d9fe4e73a4f6339
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mouse-based-optical-flow-sensor-adns3080.rst:110
#: 3352f06f80de47acbc9d2b394f0bdc18 4e130fa69ba343d29012326f11a8653d
#: 683c5b7f67e943998e9b53fff6dbd1fc a14abc66229b4b4ea3c9885b5bcf3c40
msgid ""
"The mouse sensor returns the average movement (in the x and y directions) of"
" surface features that it sees. A single pixel move will not cause the "
"sensor to return \"1\". It will return a higher value around 5. This value "
"is referred to as the **scaler** below. In the example below, the value "
"returned would be about 1.6 ( (-5+5+5) / 3)"
msgstr ""
"鼠标传感器返回其所看到的表面特征在 x 和 y 方向上的平均移动量。单个像素的移动不会使传感器返回「1」，而会返回约 5 的较高值，即下文所称的 "
"**缩放系数**。在下面的示例中，返回值约为 1.6（(-5+5+5) / 3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mouse-based-optical-flow-sensor-adns3080.rst:119
#: 15f4b58259a244008b5349f5404f488d 1fa3e54f6e754d0a99f680f3ab6b073e
#: ae5f239722164447b822de4a43c42edb d66524cdd8b6456ebe47d1a1d8c7d353
msgid ""
"**Sensor's x and y values can be converted to real distances based on "
"altitude**"
msgstr "**传感器的 x 和 y 值可根据高度换算为实际距离**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mouse-based-optical-flow-sensor-adns3080.rst:122
#: 9afe399ad3b24b729a78723f2643be53 a05c889bd2854b5aab972220fc773e59
#: b441bc4b3f624560b5b0508324c51243 f9ead9164b0c4ba2ad4f378625fdf4e6
msgid ""
"In order to convert values from the sensor to real distances moved, we need "
"to take into account the altitude. This is necessary because as you can see "
"from the two pictures below, if we have two quads moving the same distance, "
"but one at a low altitude, the other at a higher altitude, the lower quad "
"will see surface features appear to move further and this will result in a "
"higher optical flow values"
msgstr ""
"为了将传感器的数值转换为实际移动距离，需要考虑高度因素。这是必要的，因为如下图所示，如果两架四轴飞行器移动相同距离，但一架在低空、另一架在高空，低空的那架看到的表面特征移动幅度更大，导致光流值更高"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mouse-based-optical-flow-sensor-adns3080.rst:135
#: 0924603317cf4a51b898f58065d50c15 bb5b9a4a452f4598ad56d5cd4ce65cb6
